                    <div style="font-size: 2rem; background: var(--accent-teal); width: 4rem; height: 4rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; font-weight: 800;">3</div>
                    <div style="flex: 1;">
                        <strong style="font-size: var(--h3-size); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Aggressively Target the Treatment Gap</strong>
                        <span style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: var(--body-size);">Treatment exists but access and quality remain vastly inadequate globally. Combating stigma is crucial to accurate data and help-seeking.</span>
